{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"Personnes en risque de pauvreté ou d'exclusion sociale","source":"ESTAT","updated":"2026-10-05T23:00:00+0200","value":{"1":18.4,"2":18.7,"3":17.8,"4":17.9,"5":18.8,"6":19.0,"7":19.0,"8":20.7,"9":20.4,"10":20.5,"11":20.8,"13":11497,"14":11740,"15":11218,"16":11372,"17":11716,"18":12006,"19":12115,"20":13685,"21":13518,"22":13586,"23":13863,"25":22.4,"26":23.8,"27":23.5,"28":24.0,"29":24.1,"30":23.6,"31":22.5,"32":27.1,"33":26.6,"34":26.2,"35":27.5,"37":3020,"38":3248,"39":3196,"40":3253,"41":3194,"42":3138,"43":2934,"44":3709,"45":3552,"46":3591,"47":3738},"status":{"6":"b","8":"b","18":"b","20":"b","30":"b","32":"b","42":"b","44":"b"},"id":["freq","age","unit","geo","time"],"size":[1,2,2,1,12],"dimension":{"freq":{"label":"Fréquence (relative au temps)","category":{"index":{"A":0},"label":{"A":"Annuel"}}},"age":{"label":"Classe d'âge","category":{"index":{"TOTAL":0,"Y_LT18":1},"label":{"TOTAL":"Total","Y_LT18":"Moins de 18 ans"}}},"unit":{"label":"Unité de mesure","category":{"index":{"PC":0,"THS_PER":1},"label":{"PC":"Pourcentage","THS_PER":"Milliers de personnes"}}},"geo":{"label":"Entité géopolitique (déclarante)","category":{"index":{"FR":0},"label":{"FR":"France"}}},"time":{"label":"Temps","category":{"index":{"2014":0,"2015":1,"2016":2,"2017":3,"2018":4,"2019":5,"2020":6,"2021":7,"2022":8,"2023":9,"2024":10,"2025":11},"label":{"2014":"2014","2015":"2015","2016":"2016","2017":"2017","2018":"2018","2019":"2019","2020":"2020","2021":"2021","2022":"2022","2023":"2023","2024":"2024","2025":"2025"}}}},"extension":{"lang":"FR","description":"Alors que le revenu d'un ménage est un déterminant essentiel de son niveau de vie, d'autres aspects peuvent empêcher les personnes de participer pleinement à la société, tels qu'un accès entravé aux marchés du travail ou un dénuement matériel et social. Pour refléter ces différentes dimensions de la pauvreté ou de l’exclusion sociale, l’indicateur «Personnes en risque de pauvreté ou d'exclusion sociale» mesure le nombre de personnes touchées par au moins l’une des trois formes de pauvreté ou d’exclusion sociale suivantes: pauvreté monétaire (taux de risque de pauvreté), privation matérielle et sociale grave et très faible intensité de travail. Les données relatives aux trois composantes proviennent des statistiques de l’UE sur le revenu et les conditions de vie (EU-SILC).","id":"SDG_01_10","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"1.0","datastructure":{"id":"SDG_01_10","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"90.0"},"annotation":[{"type":"CREATED","date":"2017-11-06T15:09:43+0100"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_DOI_XML","title":"<adms:identifier xmlns:adms=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#\" xmlns:skos=\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core.html\" xmlns:dct=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"><adms:Identifier rdf:about=\"https://doi.org/10.2908/SDG_01_10\"><skos:notation rdf:datatype=\"http://purl.org/spar/datacite/doi\">10.2908/SDG_01_10</skos:notation><dct:creator rdf:resource=\"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/ESTAT\"/><dct:issued rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date\">2023-01-23</dct:issued></adms:Identifier></adms:identifier>"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_SDG_20260528.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_SDG_20260528.pdf","text":"Avis important"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_SDG_20260528.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_OBJECT_TYPE","title":"DATASET"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_PRESENTATIONS","title":"[{\"names\":{\"de\":{\"locale\":\"de\",\"value\":\"Standardpräsentation\",\"html\":fal